  "body": "For discerning buyers who value quality, sunshine and an exceptional outlook, 156 Landmark Terrace offers a lifestyle that is difficult to match.\r\n\r\nElevated and north-facing, this beautifully appointed, Kensington Park apartment is designed to make the most of its spectacular floor-to-ceiling outlook, spanning manicured parklands and native bush reserve to the shimmering sea and beyond. It is a home that invites you to slow down, bask in the sunshine and enjoy the ever-changing view, a true coastal retreat.\r\n\r\nAnd when you feel like exploring, simply lace up your walking shoes and follow the path through the native bush to the golden sands of Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nInside, generous open-plan living is framed by expansive picture windows, drawing the sunshine and outlook deep into the home. Elegant finishes include remote-controlled blinds, beautiful drapes and coastal louvres, while the covered north-facing balcony provides a peaceful and sheltered outdoor sanctuary. The perfect place for morning coffee, afternoon sunshine or an evening glass of wine.\r\n\r\nArriving home is effortless. Secure basement parking provides two carparks and a storage cupboard, with direct access through the foyer to your apartment. Alternatively, arrive via the impressive grand lobby and elevator.\r\n\r\nPositioned within the sought-after Kensington Park community, this is apartment living at its most refined - combining quality, privacy, sunshine and an enviable coastal setting.  Ownership in Kensington Park is open to all ages and stages, with pets welcome too.  Residents share use of the heated indoor pool, gym, sauna, petanque, picnic areas and acres of manicured park space.  \r\n\r\nA home of this calibre deserves to be experienced in person.\r\n\r\nContact Jaimee Durham on 027 389 2989 to arrange your private viewing, or visit our weekend open home.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to welcoming you to your Kensington Park lifestyle.\r\n\r\nHarcourts Files: To view/download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FDAY",
